  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Functional components",
      "items": [
        "Each pack is a vertical slice owning its controllers, Trailblazer operations, models, Pundit policies, jobs, and views",
        "core: investors, entities, documents/eSign, KYC/AML, notifications, reminders, fees, access rights",
        "funds: capital calls, commitments, distributions, remittances, fund reports/ratios, portfolios, side letters",
        "ai: assistants, chats, support/deal agents, MCP server, ruby_llm services; misc: imports, approvals, incoming email, Chewy/Elasticsearch indexing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Jobs (165 classes)",
      "items": [
        "Dedicated queues with capped concurrency: serial, doc_gen, ai_checks; db_restore runs one-at-a-time in its own capsule",
        "sidekiq-cron: SchedulerPollingJob every 10 min drives agent schedules; nightly DailyMorning, TrackingCurrency, RecurringTaskGenerator, CapitalRemittanceStatus",
        "Hourly S3Check plus backup-freshness and replication-health watchdogs alert on stale backups or broken replication"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Shared foundation (core/base)",
      "items": [
        "Base controllers, models, mailers, and helpers every pack inherits",
        "ActionMailbox mailboxes receive SendGrid Inbound Parse email; ActionCable channels power live updates at /cable",
        "Website middleware (position 0) serves caphive.com; ExceptionNotification mails production errors"
      ]
    }
  ]
}